# Remove AI marks

When asked to strip AI provenance marks, remove C2PA/Content Credentials, clean AI metadata, or inspect file provenance:

- Check that the cleaning service is running (`$WM/health` at `http://127.0.0.1:8765` or configured URL).
- Inspect candidate files with the `remove-ai-marks` skill before cleaning.
- Apply only to files and text the user owns or is authorized to process.
- Preserve file integrity, document semantics, and essential layout.
- Never alter code logic, numerical values, or citations.

